  <regions type="content">
    <region left="0" top="0" width="773" height="38" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="771" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p style="font-weight: bold;">5. Analyze the following second-order RLC low-pass network using sinusoidal transient excitation and Small-Signal AC Analysis.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="342" top="27" width="205" height="137" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="36" width="233" height="130" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="162" width="773" height="128" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="773" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>A. Sinusoidal transient response. Set V1 to the sine-wave source below and run a transient simulation. Plot V(vin) and V(vout), and measure the steady-state output amplitude and phase shift.<br /><br />Source definition: SINE(0 1 {F})<br />Parameter sweep: .step param F list 100 1.6k 10k<br />Simulation directive: .tran 0 60m 0 2u<br />Compare the three frequency cases. If you prefer, the three frequencies may be simulated manually<br />instead of using the .step directive.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="288" width="56" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>100 Hz</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="306" width="772" height="166" color="#000000">
      <picture>
        <raw format="png" encoding="base64"></raw>
      </picture>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="468" width="84" height="23" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>Phase shift:</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="486" width="178" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Vin.min_t</e>
          <e type="operand">47.500031</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">ms</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="207" top="486" width="186" height="29" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
        <input>
          <e type="operand">Vout.min_t</e>
          <e type="operand">47.568031</e>
          <e type="operand" style="unit">ms</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">*</e>
          <e type="operator" args="2">:</e>
        </input>
      </math>
    </region>
    <region left="0" top="504" width="408" height="32" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <math>
